resources.string:
A pocket assistant on one screen (More menu):
• now — the current and next meeting, “For the meeting” with related mail;
• the day at a glance — meetings and their time, the next free slot, tasks “N of M”, today’s mail;
• schedule by morning, afternoon and evening, overlapping meetings, overdue tasks;
• mail in progress — Follow-up, Later, invitations, scheduled sends; mail from VIPs;
• in the evening — how tomorrow starts.

Everything is calculated on this device, without server requests. Board view and home-screen widget are there too.

Hello,

I’m on vacation{until}. I rarely check email and will reply when I’m back.{sub}

Thank you!

Hello,

I’m out of reach{until} and can’t reply quickly. I’ll get back to you as soon as I can.{sub}

Thank you!

Hello,

I’m on sick leave{until}, so my reply may be delayed.{sub}

Thank you for your understanding!
